{"title": "Droop", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Droop</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Shrunk)\">In-Game (Shrunk)</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Extended)\">In-Game (Extended)</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Shrunk)\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Droop.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Droop.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Droop.jpg/250px-Droop.jpg?7de895\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Droop.jpg/375px-Droop.jpg?7de895 1.5x, /images/thumb/Droop.jpg/500px-Droop.jpg?7de895 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Extended)\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Droop_Extended.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Droop Extended.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Droop_Extended.jpg/250px-Droop_Extended.jpg?75b30c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Droop_Extended.jpg/375px-Droop_Extended.jpg?75b30c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Droop_Extended.jpg/500px-Droop_Extended.jpg?75b30c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nBarber</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nDroopMan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnknown</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n100</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.35</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Droop</b> is a hostile entity and a variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Barber\">Barber</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a tall, slender, and humanoid looking creature with pitch black skin. It has two glowing white eyes and a wide open mouth that emits a light below it. It will shrink itself down to fit into tighter spaces, such as moving around in the interior.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Unlike the Barber, the <b>Droop</b> is always visible. The <b>Droop</b> also does not increase or does not increase at a noticeable speed as time progresses.\n</p><p>Otherwise, the <b>Droop</b> behaves similarly to the Barber, making an audible buildup noise before stepping (teleporting) to a random location within a set distance. If a player enters its line of sight, it will attempt to move towards them. Any player that walks in-between the hands of a <b>Droop</b> will be temporarily blinded and take 100 damage. This is an important distinction from the Barber's instant kill, as it allows players to survive a hit from the <b>Droop</b> by overcapping their health with a <b>Health-stim</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Droop</b> has a 51.95% chance to spawn in the interior and a 91.67% chance to spawn on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Xenphir\" title=\"Xenphir\"><b>Xenphir</b></a>, exclusively spawning on this moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Droop <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">DROOP<br /><br />Sigurd's danger level: uhhhh I dnot know but thsi sou nds horrifyign<br /><br />Scientific name: Vorictus-detoma<br /><br />The Vorictus-detoma, garnered the name \u201cDroop\u201d due to its drooping appearance. Its arms, legs and neck are exceptionally long, likely due to the body deformation which happens in the process of a Droop\u2019s creation.<br /><br />The Droop is not officially classified as a non-human creature, while it no longer possesses the humanity it once did, it technically is still human. Only with the effects of prolonged exposure to V-Radiation.<br /><br />V-Radiation is an incredibly rare phenomenon and has previously had very adverse and unexplainable effects on creatures and places, often leading to deformation and destruction. Sightings of V-Radiation were extremely rare up until the Grand war where it was occasionally used to cause mass destruction. However, even by supporters of the use of biological warfare, it was greatly frowned upon due to its cruel and otherworldly effects often rendering places uninhabitable.<br /><br />While there have not been many encounters, the majority of the Droop were likely everyday civilians affected during the war. <br />Direct exposure to gamma or beta rays of V-Radiation vaporises the average unprotected human, leaving behind what can only be described as a shadow or a memory where they once were. It is not certain what exactly it is that they leave behind but it is thought to no longer be alive. However there have been rumors of these shadows stalking or moving in the dark.<br />When exposed to alpha rays of V-Radiation you won\u2019t immediately notice any harmful effects aside from a slight headache or brief dizziness. But from the moment of exposure you have been infected with a unique type of radiation sickness. While it doesn\u2019t break your DNA, it does change it which only becomes noticeable after a few days. Skin might start feeling heavy and organs might move around during a very painful process. If the infected is still alive 13 days past the first exposure, changes start happening to the brain, often noting highly irregular brainwaves. From this point onwards it is only a husk of its former self. While it is on a technical level not death, this is what we consider the moment of death. The person is unrecoverable and the body is deformed to an unrecognisable level where the skin and muscles resemble a droopy obsidian. <br /><br />There has not been any research from this point onwards.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Building-Up</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopmanBuildUp.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopmanBuildUp.mp3?a0cbd8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopmanBuildUp.mp3/DroopmanBuildUp.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stepping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopmanStep1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopmanStep1.mp3?1fbce1\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopmanStep1.mp3/DroopmanStep1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopmanStep2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopmanStep2.mp3?f8df10\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopmanStep2.mp3/DroopmanStep2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopmanStep3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopmanStep3.mp3?e10677\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopmanStep3.mp3/DroopmanStep3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopmanStep4.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopmanStep4.mp3?80db60\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopmanStep4.mp3/DroopmanStep4.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attacking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"DroopAttack.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DroopAttack.mp3?a3e518\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DroopAttack.mp3/DroopAttack.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DroopDark.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Droop in the dark on the exterior.\"><img alt=\"The Droop in the dark on the exterior.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DroopDark.jpg/120px-DroopDark.jpg?46f8e9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DroopDark.jpg/180px-DroopDark.jpg?46f8e9 1.5x, /images/thumb/DroopDark.jpg/240px-DroopDark.jpg?46f8e9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Droop in the dark on the exterior.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DroopRubber.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Droop in the Rubber Rooms.\"><img alt=\"The Droop in the Rubber Rooms.